From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:20:03 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] media: qcom: camss: csiphy-3ph: Add Gen2 v1.2.3 two-phase
 MIPI CSI-2 DPHY support
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add the lane settings of the 4 nm two-phase CSIPHY v1.2.3 found on the
SM6450, from the vendor driver's DPHY table. Common control 7 and 9
come first, so that they override the defaults written before the lanes
are configured.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 .../qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c         | 95 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 95 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
index a229ba04b..752af0b7b 100644
--- a/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
+++ b/drivers/media/platform/qcom/camss/camss-csiphy-3ph-1-0.c
@@ -482,6 +482,96 @@ csiphy_lane_regs lane_regs_qcm2290[] = {
 	{0x0664, 0x3f, 0x00, CSIPHY_DEFAULT_PARAMS},
 };
 
